# m5max-40c-swift15-q80-v2.choices: v1 (below) plus the DFlash draft's affine projections at 1-4 lanes
# from m5max-40c-swift15-v12.choices (every GGUF model runs Inco's affine DFlash2 draft; v1 left it on
# defaults). Affine lines key affine workloads only, so the GGUF target is unchanged.
# splash-m5: GGUF Q8_0 (Swift-1.5 Q8 assembly) decode choices, M5 Max 40 cores.
# Measured with dev/m5/kernel-bench --gguf q80 --candidates (fp64-checked); only
# shapes where a candidate beat the planner's split rule in two repeat runs.
